Built from the Kiosk Satellite plugin template
(https://github.com/jxlarrea/kiosk-satellite-plugins), Apache-2.0.
The SDK sources under sdk/ and the build tools under tools/ come from that
template.

Kiosk Satellite itself is a separate work by Xavier Larrea under its own license
and is not part of this repository.

The bar's visual style — the surface, the rounded indicator pills behind the
icons, the pressed feedback without animation and the sizing of cells and
glyphs — follows the Navbar for Kiosk Satellite by Dima Tokar
(https://github.com/dimatx/kiosk-satellite-navbar), Apache-2.0. Many thanks to
Dima Tokar for the design; this plugin reimplements that look for the QR bar
without copying its source.

The QR encoder is Nayuki's QR-Code-generator
(https://www.nayuki.io/page/qr-code-generator-library), MIT, bundled under
src/io/nayuki/qrcodegen.
